sequenceDiagram
    participant Backend
    participant AIGW as AI Gateway
    participant Cache
    participant Ledger
    participant API as AI API
    participant Ollama as Local Ollama
    participant Mock

    Backend->>AIGW: AI job request
    AIGW->>AIGW: Normalize + hash prompt
    AIGW->>Cache: Lookup cache_key
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>AIGW: Cached response
        AIGW-->>Backend: Return cached response
    else Cache miss
        AIGW->>Ledger: Check daily/monthly budget
        alt Over budget
            AIGW->>Mock: Generate mock/template result
            Mock-->>AIGW: Fallback result
        else Under budget
            AIGW->>API: Call primary provider
            alt API success
                API-->>AIGW: Result
            else API failed
                AIGW->>Ollama: Try local fallback
                alt Ollama success
                    Ollama-->>AIGW: Result
                else Fallback failed
                    AIGW->>Mock: Use mock/template
                    Mock-->>AIGW: Result
                end
            end
        end
        AIGW->>AIGW: Validate schema
        AIGW->>Cache: Save result
        AIGW->>Ledger: Save tokens/cost/status
        AIGW-->>Backend: Return result
    end
